{"id":"forecast-14","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-14/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":1041.41,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.02,"text":"Part 4. You will hear a university lecturer talking about three theories of intelligence and their","words":[["Part",0.0,0.28],["4.",0.28,0.78],["You",1.56,2.3],["will",2.3,2.48],["hear",2.48,2.74],["a",2.74,2.94],["university",2.94,3.5],["lecturer",3.5,4.14],["talking",4.14,4.72],["about",4.72,5.18],["three",5.18,5.64],["theories",5.64,6.08],["of",6.08,6.36],["intelligence",6.36,6.96],["and",6.96,7.84],["their",7.84,8.02]]},{"start":8.02,"end":66.57,"text":"implications for how we learn. First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now","words":[["implications",8.02,8.58],["for",8.58,9.12],["how",9.12,9.44],["we",9.44,9.66],["learn.",9.66,10.08],["First,",11.3,12.14],["you",12.32,12.4],["have",12.4,12.56],["some",12.56,12.76],["time",12.76,13.18],["to",13.18,13.48],["look",13.48,13.62],["at",13.62,13.76],["questions",13.76,14.1],["31",14.1,14.92],["to",14.92,15.2],["40.",15.2,15.6],["Now",66.21,66.57]]},{"start":66.57,"end":76.66,"text":"listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40. Today I am going to consider three theories","words":[["listen",66.57,66.93],["carefully",66.93,67.43],["and",67.43,67.81],["answer",67.81,68.25],["questions",68.25,68.73],["31",68.73,69.55],["to",69.55,69.81],["40.",69.81,70.19],["Today",73.56,74.08],["I",74.08,74.54],["am",74.54,74.64],["going",74.64,74.84],["to",74.84,75.0],["consider",75.0,75.5],["three",75.5,76.06],["theories",76.06,76.66]]},{"start":76.66,"end":82.38,"text":"of intelligence and look at their implications for studying effectively while you are here","words":[["of",76.66,76.96],["intelligence",76.96,77.52],["and",77.52,78.52],["look",78.52,78.78],["at",78.78,78.94],["their",78.94,79.04],["implications",79.04,79.78],["for",79.78,80.44],["studying",80.44,80.84],["effectively",80.84,81.38],["while",81.38,81.88],["you",81.88,82.06],["are",82.06,82.16],["here",82.16,82.38]]},{"start":82.38,"end":90.46,"text":"at university. Early psychologists such as Spearman in the 1920s believed that each individual","words":[["at",82.38,82.52],["university.",82.52,83.18],["Early",84.3,84.96],["psychologists",84.96,85.62],["such",85.62,86.06],["as",86.06,86.3],["Spearman",86.3,86.92],["in",86.92,87.2],["the",87.2,87.28],["1920s",87.28,88.52],["believed",88.52,89.22],["that",89.22,89.64],["each",89.64,89.9],["individual",89.9,90.46]]},{"start":90.46,"end":98.86,"text":"has a single general level of intelligence known as the intelligence quotient or IQ. According","words":[["has",90.46,91.06],["a",91.06,91.22],["single",91.22,91.62],["general",91.62,92.42],["level",92.42,92.86],["of",92.86,93.02],["intelligence",93.02,93.62],["known",93.62,94.54],["as",94.54,95.1],["the",95.1,95.28],["intelligence",95.28,95.82],["quotient",95.82,96.54],["or",96.54,97.06],["IQ.",97.06,97.56],["According",98.38,98.86]]},{"start":98.86,"end":104.24,"text":"to that theory we're born with a certain level of intelligence which is inherited","words":[["to",98.86,99.26],["that",99.26,99.48],["theory",99.48,99.86],["we're",99.86,100.56],["born",100.56,100.82],["with",100.82,101.42],["a",101.42,101.58],["certain",101.58,101.86],["level",101.86,102.26],["of",102.26,102.44],["intelligence",102.44,103.02],["which",103.02,103.66],["is",103.66,103.88],["inherited",103.88,104.24]]},{"start":104.24,"end":111.0,"text":"from our parents and our intelligence remains constant throughout our life. It follows","words":[["from",104.24,104.58],["our",104.58,104.74],["parents",104.74,105.3],["and",105.3,106.2],["our",106.2,106.38],["intelligence",106.38,106.88],["remains",106.88,107.34],["constant",107.34,108.02],["throughout",108.02,108.5],["our",108.5,108.86],["life.",108.86,109.28],["It",109.96,110.68],["follows",110.68,111.0]]},{"start":111.0,"end":116.36,"text":"knows that any intelligence test we do at any time will give broadly similar results.","words":[["knows",111.0,111.24],["that",111.24,111.4],["any",111.4,111.7],["intelligence",111.7,112.22],["test",112.22,112.62],["we",112.62,112.86],["do",112.86,113.14],["at",113.14,113.48],["any",113.48,113.74],["time",113.74,114.12],["will",114.12,114.68],["give",114.68,114.9],["broadly",114.9,115.42],["similar",115.42,115.74],["results.",115.74,116.36]]},{"start":117.2,"end":123.44,"text":"If this is true, it suggests that there isn't much you can do to make yourself more intelligent","words":[["If",117.2,117.76],["this",117.76,117.98],["is",117.98,118.12],["true,",118.12,118.48],["it",119.06,119.28],["suggests",119.28,119.62],["that",119.62,120.0],["there",120.0,120.2],["isn't",120.2,120.48],["much",120.48,120.7],["you",120.7,120.94],["can",120.94,121.1],["do",121.1,121.42],["to",121.42,121.9],["make",121.9,122.08],["yourself",122.08,122.48],["more",122.48,122.82],["intelligent",122.82,123.44]]},{"start":123.44,"end":129.04,"text":"since it's a genetic feature. You wouldn't be able to perform any better in your studies","words":[["since",123.44,124.04],["it's",124.04,124.46],["a",124.46,124.54],["genetic",124.54,124.84],["feature.",124.84,125.32],["You",126.32,126.64],["wouldn't",126.64,126.98],["be",126.98,127.14],["able",127.14,127.32],["to",127.32,127.42],["perform",127.42,127.68],["any",127.68,127.96],["better",127.96,128.3],["in",128.3,128.52],["your",128.52,128.64],["studies",128.64,129.04]]},{"start":129.04,"end":135.48,"text":"than you do now. Most of the evidence for the genetic origin of intelligence has come","words":[["than",129.04,129.28],["you",129.28,129.46],["do",129.46,129.62],["now.",129.62,129.94],["Most",130.96,131.6],["of",131.6,131.82],["the",131.82,131.92],["evidence",131.92,132.42],["for",132.42,132.72],["the",132.72,132.88],["genetic",132.88,133.26],["origin",133.26,133.76],["of",133.76,133.96],["intelligence",133.96,134.56],["has",134.56,135.24],["come",135.24,135.48]]},{"start":135.48,"end":140.38,"text":"from studies of twins, which show a considerable similarity in their intelligence.","words":[["from",135.48,135.7],["studies",135.7,136.08],["of",136.08,136.32],["twins,",136.32,136.74],["which",137.18,137.62],["show",137.62,137.92],["a",137.92,138.04],["considerable",138.04,138.52],["similarity",138.52,139.12],["in",139.12,139.64],["their",139.64,139.86],["intelligence.",139.86,140.38]]},{"start":141.72,"end":147.46,"text":"However, other psychologists have interpreted the findings of this research differently,","words":[["However,",141.72,142.52],["other",143.18,143.52],["psychologists",143.52,144.22],["have",144.22,144.68],["interpreted",144.68,145.24],["the",145.24,145.48],["findings",145.48,145.86],["of",145.86,146.16],["this",146.16,146.36],["research",146.36,146.88],["differently,",146.88,147.46]]},{"start":148.22,"end":154.0,"text":"arguing that genetic influence plays only a small part in our intelligence, or even","words":[["arguing",148.22,148.68],["that",148.68,149.4],["genetic",149.4,149.74],["influence",149.74,150.4],["plays",150.4,150.9],["only",150.9,151.22],["a",151.22,151.4],["small",151.4,151.68],["part",151.68,152.18],["in",152.18,152.34],["our",152.34,152.48],["intelligence,",152.48,152.96],["or",153.3,153.7],["even",153.7,154.0]]},{"start":154.0,"end":160.32,"text":"no part at all. Their theory says that the similarity in intelligence between the","words":[["no",154.0,154.28],["part",154.28,154.6],["at",154.6,154.76],["all.",154.76,155.1],["Their",156.16,156.56],["theory",156.56,156.96],["says",156.96,157.4],["that",157.4,158.12],["the",158.12,158.24],["similarity",158.24,158.7],["in",158.7,159.08],["intelligence",159.08,159.58],["between",159.58,160.04],["the",160.04,160.32]]},{"start":160.32,"end":166.14,"text":"subjects used in such studies may have an environmental rather than genetic origin.","words":[["subjects",160.32,160.66],["used",160.66,161.08],["in",161.08,161.3],["such",161.3,161.54],["studies",161.54,161.96],["may",161.96,162.8],["have",162.8,163.14],["an",163.14,163.32],["environmental",163.32,163.9],["rather",163.9,164.92],["than",164.92,165.16],["genetic",165.16,165.6],["origin.",165.6,166.14]]},{"start":167.4,"end":173.24,"text":"These psychologists point out that children brought up in the same family are likely to","words":[["These",167.4,167.78],["psychologists",167.78,168.24],["point",168.24,168.94],["out",168.94,169.32],["that",169.32,169.92],["children",169.92,170.36],["brought",170.36,170.82],["up",170.82,171.08],["in",171.08,171.22],["the",171.22,171.3],["same",171.3,171.64],["family",171.64,172.16],["are",172.16,172.72],["likely",172.72,173.04],["to",173.04,173.24]]},{"start":173.24,"end":179.66,"text":"have experiences which are very similar. This rather than their genetic inheritance may","words":[["have",173.24,173.38],["experiences",173.38,174.06],["which",174.06,174.34],["are",174.34,174.46],["very",174.46,174.72],["similar.",174.72,175.08],["This",176.16,176.6],["rather",176.6,177.32],["than",177.32,177.6],["their",177.6,177.76],["genetic",177.76,178.18],["inheritance",178.18,178.92],["may",178.92,179.66]]},{"start":179.66,"end":183.32,"text":"be the main reason why they have similar levels of intelligence.","words":[["be",179.66,179.96],["the",179.96,180.12],["main",180.12,180.38],["reason",180.38,180.82],["why",180.82,181.44],["they",181.44,181.62],["have",181.62,181.9],["similar",181.9,182.3],["levels",182.3,182.66],["of",182.66,182.86],["intelligence.",182.86,183.32]]},{"start":184.96,"end":192.24,"text":"Take the case of the Ravens test, an intelligence test used to measure abstract reasoning ability.","words":[["Take",184.96,185.72],["the",185.72,185.94],["case",185.94,186.28],["of",186.28,186.78],["the",186.78,186.94],["Ravens",186.94,187.56],["test,",187.56,187.82],["an",188.5,188.78],["intelligence",188.78,189.16],["test",189.16,189.6],["used",189.6,189.98],["to",189.98,190.24],["measure",190.24,190.52],["abstract",190.52,191.22],["reasoning",191.22,191.62],["ability.",191.62,192.24]]},{"start":193.4,"end":200.3,"text":"The Ravens test was designed for use with people of any language, age or country, so","words":[["The",193.4,193.94],["Ravens",193.94,194.54],["test",194.54,194.76],["was",194.76,195.0],["designed",195.0,195.44],["for",195.44,195.72],["use",195.72,195.96],["with",195.96,196.36],["people",196.36,196.84],["of",196.84,197.08],["any",197.08,197.4],["language,",197.4,197.86],["age",198.28,198.56],["or",198.56,198.82],["country,",198.82,199.32],["so",199.96,200.3]]},{"start":200.3,"end":205.3,"text":"in theory a person's result shouldn't be affected by where they grow up.","words":[["in",200.3,200.62],["theory",200.62,201.04],["a",201.04,201.56],["person's",201.56,202.08],["result",202.08,202.58],["shouldn't",202.58,203.34],["be",203.34,203.46],["affected",203.46,203.92],["by",203.92,204.24],["where",204.24,204.5],["they",204.5,204.68],["grow",204.68,204.92],["up.",204.92,205.3]]},{"start":206.0,"end":212.06,"text":"Yet some research using Ravens into children who moved home and lived in another culture","words":[["Yet",206.0,206.48],["some",206.48,206.76],["research",206.76,207.4],["using",207.4,207.92],["Ravens",207.92,208.82],["into",208.82,209.24],["children",209.24,209.64],["who",209.64,209.9],["moved",209.9,210.24],["home",210.24,210.62],["and",210.62,210.84],["lived",210.84,211.12],["in",211.12,211.32],["another",211.32,211.52],["culture",211.52,212.06]]},{"start":212.06,"end":218.9,"text":"found that after a few years there was a significant improvement in their results. In other words,","words":[["found",212.06,212.96],["that",212.96,213.2],["after",213.2,213.48],["a",213.48,213.68],["few",213.68,213.84],["years",213.84,214.36],["there",214.36,214.82],["was",214.82,214.96],["a",214.96,215.12],["significant",215.12,215.46],["improvement",215.46,216.2],["in",216.2,216.5],["their",216.5,216.7],["results.",216.7,217.26],["In",218.08,218.24],["other",218.24,218.38],["words,",218.38,218.9]]},{"start":219.28,"end":230.2,"text":"our intelligence isn't fixed. An alternative view which is significantly different is that","words":[["our",219.28,219.52],["intelligence",219.52,220.02],["isn't",220.02,220.68],["fixed.",220.68,221.06],["An",226.66,226.88],["alternative",226.88,227.3],["view",227.3,227.82],["which",227.82,228.1],["is",228.1,228.24],["significantly",228.24,228.76],["different",228.76,229.32],["is",229.32,230.08],["that",230.08,230.2]]},{"start":230.2,"end":233.8,"text":"we have multiple intelligences, not one general one.","words":[["we",230.2,230.36],["have",230.36,230.62],["multiple",230.62,231.08],["intelligences,",231.08,232.02],["not",232.4,232.62],["one",232.62,233.02],["general",233.02,233.38],["one.",233.38,233.8]]},{"start":234.64,"end":240.74,"text":"In the 1990s Howard Gardner claimed that there are at least seven separate intelligences.","words":[["In",234.64,235.02],["the",235.02,235.12],["1990s",235.12,236.3],["Howard",236.3,236.86],["Gardner",236.86,237.38],["claimed",237.38,237.84],["that",237.84,238.32],["there",238.32,238.44],["are",238.44,238.58],["at",238.58,238.76],["least",238.76,238.9],["seven",238.9,239.38],["separate",239.38,239.94],["intelligences.",239.94,240.74]]},{"start":240.74,"end":248.72,"text":"The list includes what you might expect, such as linguistic and logical skills, and also","words":[["The",240.74,242.16],["list",242.16,242.36],["includes",242.36,242.72],["what",242.72,243.06],["you",243.06,243.24],["might",243.24,243.44],["expect,",243.44,243.86],["such",244.52,244.8],["as",244.8,245.24],["linguistic",245.24,245.84],["and",245.84,246.46],["logical",246.46,246.88],["skills,",246.88,247.34],["and",247.96,248.24],["also",248.24,248.72]]},{"start":248.72,"end":253.1,"text":"other, less traditional ones, such as a category of musical abilities.","words":[["other,",248.72,249.2],["less",249.44,249.72],["traditional",249.72,250.16],["ones,",250.16,250.64],["such",251.08,251.38],["as",251.38,251.52],["a",251.52,251.62],["category",251.62,251.98],["of",251.98,252.22],["musical",252.22,252.58],["abilities.",252.58,253.1]]},{"start":254.44,"end":260.36,"text":"Research in neuropsychology suggests that different cognitive abilities, such as speech,","words":[["Research",254.44,255.16],["in",255.16,255.5],["neuropsychology",255.5,256.44],["suggests",256.44,257.26],["that",257.26,257.62],["different",257.62,257.98],["cognitive",257.98,258.46],["abilities,",258.46,258.98],["such",259.44,259.82],["as",259.82,260.0],["speech,",260.0,260.36]]},{"start":260.92,"end":265.94,"text":"may be partially independent of each other, and controlled by different circuits within","words":[["may",260.92,261.2],["be",261.2,261.42],["partially",261.42,261.84],["independent",261.84,262.46],["of",262.46,262.74],["each",262.74,262.88],["other,",262.88,263.2],["and",263.56,263.9],["controlled",263.9,264.48],["by",264.48,264.82],["different",264.82,265.16],["circuits",265.16,265.66],["within",265.66,265.94]]},{"start":265.94,"end":266.42,"text":"the brain.","words":[["the",265.94,266.1],["brain.",266.1,266.42]]},{"start":267.26,"end":272.5,"text":"Support for this theory comes from the fact that some people show a weakness in one particular","words":[["Support",267.26,268.02],["for",268.02,268.32],["this",268.32,268.5],["theory",268.5,268.88],["comes",268.88,269.48],["from",269.48,269.72],["the",269.72,269.84],["fact",269.84,270.04],["that",270.04,270.22],["some",270.22,270.48],["people",270.48,270.82],["show",270.82,271.1],["a",271.1,271.24],["weakness",271.24,271.56],["in",271.56,271.88],["one",271.88,272.1],["particular",272.1,272.5]]},{"start":272.5,"end":279.86,"text":"area. For instance, some find it very difficult to recognise someone's face, while they may","words":[["area.",272.5,273.12],["For",273.88,274.32],["instance,",274.32,274.6],["some",275.32,275.68],["find",275.68,276.04],["it",276.04,276.22],["very",276.22,276.5],["difficult",276.5,276.94],["to",276.94,277.22],["recognise",277.22,277.62],["someone's",277.62,278.32],["face,",278.32,278.58],["while",279.16,279.46],["they",279.46,279.66],["may",279.66,279.86]]},{"start":279.86,"end":286.56,"text":"have no problem remembering names. This apparent variation in strengths and weaknesses within","words":[["have",279.86,280.1],["no",280.1,280.28],["problem",280.28,280.64],["remembering",280.64,281.12],["names.",281.12,281.74],["This",282.92,283.32],["apparent",283.32,283.86],["variation",283.86,284.34],["in",284.34,284.72],["strengths",284.72,285.1],["and",285.1,285.44],["weaknesses",285.44,285.9],["within",285.9,286.56]]},{"start":286.56,"end":293.02,"text":"one person supports Gardner's view that intelligence is multiple rather than general.","words":[["one",286.56,286.82],["person",286.82,287.36],["supports",287.36,288.22],["Gardner's",288.22,289.02],["view",289.02,289.26],["that",289.26,289.84],["intelligence",289.84,290.36],["is",290.36,291.04],["multiple",291.04,291.54],["rather",291.54,292.32],["than",292.32,292.58],["general.",292.58,293.02]]},{"start":293.02,"end":300.5,"text":"Well, Gardner suggests that the various intelligences don't operate in isolation from each other,","words":[["Well,",293.02,293.12],["Gardner",294.24,294.96],["suggests",294.96,295.34],["that",295.34,296.16],["the",296.16,296.3],["various",296.3,296.68],["intelligences",296.68,297.52],["don't",297.52,298.4],["operate",298.4,298.86],["in",298.86,299.18],["isolation",299.18,299.6],["from",299.6,299.94],["each",299.94,300.14],["other,",300.14,300.5]]},{"start":301.02,"end":308.02,"text":"and instead that interaction between them creates a far more complex picture and greatly increases","words":[["and",301.02,301.24],["instead",301.24,301.74],["that",301.74,302.38],["interaction",302.38,302.96],["between",302.96,303.4],["them",303.4,303.74],["creates",303.74,304.34],["a",304.34,304.54],["far",304.54,304.88],["more",304.88,305.1],["complex",305.1,305.66],["picture",305.66,306.14],["and",306.14,307.02],["greatly",307.02,307.38],["increases",307.38,308.02]]},{"start":308.02,"end":314.98,"text":"what we can achieve. If this is the case, and it seems likely, we can consciously","words":[["what",308.02,308.32],["we",308.32,308.52],["can",308.52,308.68],["achieve.",308.68,309.06],["If",310.16,310.72],["this",310.72,311.0],["is",311.0,311.14],["the",311.14,311.28],["case,",311.28,311.8],["and",312.18,312.36],["it",312.36,312.52],["seems",312.52,312.9],["likely,",312.9,313.38],["we",314.08,314.26],["can",314.26,314.44],["consciously",314.44,314.98]]},{"start":314.98,"end":320.98,"text":"use this knowledge in our own approach to studying and learning. If you develop a","words":[["use",314.98,315.42],["this",315.42,315.7],["knowledge",315.7,316.08],["in",316.08,316.58],["our",316.58,316.74],["own",316.74,317.04],["approach",317.04,317.42],["to",317.42,317.66],["studying",317.66,318.04],["and",318.04,318.26],["learning.",318.26,318.6],["If",319.54,320.3],["you",320.3,320.44],["develop",320.44,320.76],["a",320.76,320.98]]},{"start":320.98,"end":326.82,"text":"sense of rhythm, this can improve not only music and dance, as you would expect, but","words":[["sense",320.98,321.16],["of",321.16,321.34],["rhythm,",321.34,321.76],["this",322.3,322.56],["can",322.56,322.74],["improve",322.74,323.16],["not",323.16,323.36],["only",323.36,323.78],["music",323.78,324.2],["and",324.2,324.46],["dance,",324.46,324.98],["as",325.26,325.44],["you",325.44,325.56],["would",325.56,325.64],["expect,",325.64,326.06],["but",326.54,326.82]]},{"start":326.82,"end":331.0,"text":"also areas that aren't obviously linked. Spelling, for instance.","words":[["also",326.82,327.14],["areas",327.14,327.62],["that",327.62,328.12],["aren't",328.12,328.38],["obviously",328.38,328.8],["linked.",328.8,329.24],["Spelling,",330.04,330.5],["for",330.64,330.72],["instance.",330.72,331.0]]},{"start":332.56,"end":338.52,"text":"If you need to learn a chemical formula, or law of physics by heart, turn it into a song.","words":[["If",332.56,332.76],["you",332.76,332.92],["need",332.92,333.06],["to",333.06,333.26],["learn",333.26,333.52],["a",333.52,333.68],["chemical",333.68,334.02],["formula,",334.02,334.62],["or",335.06,335.32],["law",335.32,335.58],["of",335.58,335.82],["physics",335.82,336.1],["by",336.1,336.42],["heart,",336.42,336.86],["turn",337.5,337.72],["it",337.72,337.86],["into",337.86,338.04],["a",338.04,338.16],["song.",338.16,338.52]]},{"start":338.98,"end":342.86,"text":"It doesn't matter at all if you're out of key, but it'll be easier for you to","words":[["It",338.98,339.14],["doesn't",339.14,339.4],["matter",339.4,339.64],["at",339.64,339.8],["all",339.8,340.04],["if",340.04,340.18],["you're",340.18,340.34],["out",340.34,340.48],["of",340.48,340.68],["key,",340.68,340.98],["but",341.38,341.7],["it'll",341.7,341.9],["be",341.9,342.02],["easier",342.02,342.42],["for",342.42,342.58],["you",342.58,342.72],["to",342.72,342.86]]},{"start":342.86,"end":349.18,"text":"learn it. That's just one way of using multiple intelligences to make studying easier","words":[["learn",342.86,343.12],["it.",343.12,343.38],["That's",344.26,344.78],["just",344.78,344.96],["one",344.96,345.28],["way",345.28,345.58],["of",345.58,345.8],["using",345.8,346.16],["multiple",346.16,346.54],["intelligences",346.54,347.36],["to",347.36,347.92],["make",347.92,348.14],["studying",348.14,348.52],["easier",348.52,349.18]]},{"start":349.18,"end":350.76,"text":"and much more fun.","words":[["and",349.18,349.36],["much",349.36,350.2],["more",350.2,350.4],["fun.",350.4,350.76]]},{"start":351.62,"end":354.4,"text":"Now, let's go on to...","words":[["Now,",351.62,352.26],["let's",352.72,353.22],["go",353.22,353.36],["on",353.36,353.62],["to...",353.62,354.4]]},{"start":357.47,"end":359.23,"text":"That is the end of part four.","words":[["That",357.47,357.79],["is",357.79,357.93],["the",357.93,358.05],["end",358.05,358.37],["of",358.37,358.55],["part",358.55,358.79],["four.",358.79,359.23]]},{"start":359.87,"end":363.55,"text":"You now have one minute to check your answers to part four.","words":[["You",359.87,360.19],["now",360.19,360.45],["have",360.45,360.79],["one",360.79,361.09],["minute",361.09,361.53],["to",361.53,361.83],["check",361.83,362.13],["your",362.13,362.33],["answers",362.33,362.69],["to",362.69,362.97],["part",362.97,363.17],["four.",363.17,363.55]]},{"start":423.54,"end":425.62,"text":"That is the end of the listening test.","words":[["That",423.54,424.02],["is",424.02,424.18],["the",424.18,424.34],["end",424.34,424.66],["of",424.66,424.86],["the",424.86,424.98],["listening",424.98,425.24],["test.",425.24,425.62]]},{"start":426.38,"end":431.36,"text":"You now have ten minutes to transfer your answers to the listening answer sheet.","words":[["You",426.38,426.58],["now",426.58,426.84],["have",426.84,427.24],["ten",427.24,427.54],["minutes",427.54,427.94],["to",427.94,428.3],["transfer",428.3,428.82],["your",428.82,429.08],["answers",429.08,429.46],["to",429.46,430.02],["the",430.02,430.16],["listening",430.16,430.5],["answer",430.5,430.96],["sheet.",430.96,431.36]]},{"start":912.23,"end":913.53,"text":"You have two minutes left.","words":[["You",912.23,912.53],["have",912.53,912.69],["two",912.69,912.91],["minutes",912.91,913.19],["left.",913.19,913.53]]},{"start":973.76,"end":974.96,"text":"You have one minute left.","words":[["You",973.76,973.92],["have",973.92,974.12],["one",974.12,974.36],["minute",974.36,974.62],["left.",974.62,974.96]]},{"start":1035.09,"end":1038.99,"text":"Please stop writing and wait for your question booklet to be collected.","words":[["Please",1035.09,1035.51],["stop",1035.51,1035.93],["writing",1035.93,1036.37],["and",1036.37,1036.75],["wait",1036.75,1036.93],["for",1036.93,1037.09],["your",1037.09,1037.23],["question",1037.23,1037.59],["booklet",1037.59,1037.97],["to",1037.97,1038.31],["be",1038.31,1038.51],["collected.",1038.51,1038.99]]}]}